// The slow drift every text paint's field moves along: a Lissajous figure
// across two axes, read from the moment the paint stands at, so a field
// whose time is bound drifts as it plays.
float2 textPaintDrift() {
  return float2(sin(time * 0.83), cos(time * 0.61));
}

// The box the field is authored over, in the points it is painted at: the
// stated box is a share of the box the paint is laid over, whose size is
// the resolution — a passage's band for an ink, a node's box for a fill.
float2 fieldOrigin() {
  return origin * uResolution;
}
float2 fieldExtent() {
  return extent * uResolution;
}
